BUG FIXES
==========

Version 1.4 has the following bug fixes.

1) The Message selection list now selects the indicated message, and not
   the next message.

2) The zip and unzip commands can now be controlled via the environment to
   maintain compatibility. QMR had a problem with new versions of unzip.

