NEW FEATURES:
=============

News Mode
       What  is News  mode  ?   Well  since QWK is such a limited
       (stupid ?) format, it is totally  unsuitable  for  Usenet
       News.  To this end techniques have been developed to allow
       a QWK mail message to be used as a source for news.

       This is accomplished by including the  needed  information
       in the actual message body. This is needed as the standard
       QWK message header is too small to even contain some names
       used  for newsgroups. Three basic fields are needed, News-
       groups: Subject: and From:.

