Some more bug fixes.
Improvements to the XmApp class.
Additional member functions for various classes.
Object colors and cursor shapes.
Updated and improved Xm++ documentation.
Most of the library code has been PURIFIED!


Btw.: This release was not tested with X11R6 but I hope it will be 
as compatible as with R3, R4 and R5. If you use X11R6 and encounter
problems please let me know, I'll try to make a fix. (Or move the
