Project version 3.1 product provides software which is _based_ on X11R6, but 
by no means is it "X11R6", which is a seperately created/maintained product of 
the X Consortium, to which The XFree86 Project is both a member and 
contributor. When referring to XFree86 software, the proper reference is 
"XFree86(TM)", which is a recognized trademark of The XFree86 Project, Inc.

