  http://pfah.informatik.uni-kl.de:8000/pers/jmayer/linux68k-faq
  ftp://tsx-11.mit.edu/pub/linux/680x0/FAQ (or any tsx-11 mirror)
Linux/68k  0.9 PL 4 released
